#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:278
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_RocketLaunchImminent"
msgid "The rocket's launch is imminent!$"
msgstr "火箭即将发射！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:281
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_SuccessfulLaunchNumber"
msgid ""
"The rocket launched safely!\n"
"That's successful launch no. {STR_VAR_1}!$"
msgstr ""
"火箭平安发射了！\n"
"这是第{STR_VAR_1}次成功发射！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:285
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_HaywireButRocketLaunchImminent"
msgid ""
"I know that things are a little\n"
"haywire right now, but…\p"
"The rocket's launch is imminent!$"
msgstr ""
"我知道现在有点乱，\n"
"不过……\p"
"火箭即将发射！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:290
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_HaywireButSuccessfulLaunchNumber"
msgid ""
"I know that things are a little\n"
"haywire right now, but…\p"
"The rocket launched safely!\n"
"That's successful launch no. {STR_VAR_1}!$"
msgstr ""
"我知道现在有点乱，\n"
"不过……\p"
"火箭平安发射了！\n"
"这是第{STR_VAR_1}次成功发射！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:296
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_RocketLaunchDemandsPerfection"
msgid ""
"A rocket launch demands perfection.\n"
"Not even a 1% margin of error is allowed.\p"
"Even if it's 99% okay, the whole thing\n"
"is useless if 1% happens to be no good.\p"
"Despite that, we never stop trying.\n"
"Why? It's a dream that never ends.$"
msgstr ""
"火箭发射要求完美无缺。\n"
"连1%的误差都不允许。\p"
"就算99%都没问题，\n"
"只要有1%出错，一切就都白费了。\p"
"尽管如此，我们从未停止尝试。\n"
"为什么？因为这是永无止境的梦想。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:304
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_MagmaHaveSightsOnSpaceCenter"
msgid ""
"Those MAGMA thugs have their sights\n"
"set on our SPACE CENTER.\p"
"But we can't allow anything that minor\n"
"to interfere with our rocket launch!$"
msgstr ""
"熔岩队那帮暴徒\n"
"盯上了我们的宇宙中心。\p"
"不过，我们可不能让这种小事\n"
"妨碍火箭发射！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:310
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_FoundThisYouCanHaveIt"
msgid ""
"I was taking a stroll down the beach\n"
"when I found this.\p"
"It's not anything I need, so you can\n"
"have it.$"
msgstr ""
"我在海滩上散步的时候，\n"
"发现了这个。\p"
"我用不着，\n"
"就送给你吧。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:316
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_HoennFamousForMeteorShowers"
msgid ""
"The HOENN region has been famous for \n"
"its meteor showers for a long time.$"
msgstr ""
"丰缘地区自古以来\n"
"就以流星雨闻名。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:320
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_MagmaCantStealFuelTakeThis"
msgid ""
"TEAM MAGMA can't be allowed to steal\n"
"the rocket fuel.\p"
"Oh, by the way, you can have this stone\n"
"I found on the beach.$"
msgstr ""
"绝不能让熔岩队\n"
"偷走火箭燃料。\p"
"哦，对了，我在海滩上\n"
"捡到了这块石头，送给你吧。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:326
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_CantStrollOnBeachWithMagma"
msgid ""
"With TEAM MAGMA around, I guess\n"
"strolls on the beach aren't safe.$"
msgstr ""
"有熔岩队在附近，\n"
"看来在海滩上散步也不安全了。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:330
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_DidPokemonComeFromSpace"
msgid ""
"Some people claim that POKéMON came\n"
"from space. Could it be true?$"
msgstr ""
"有人说宝可梦是从宇宙来的。\n"
"会是真的吗？$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:334
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_AquaShouldBeatMagma"
msgid ""
"TEAM AQUA should take care of\n"
"TEAM MAGMA!\p"
"But if they did that, TEAM AQUA will\n"
"become bold and brazen, won't they?$"
msgstr ""
"海洋队应该去收拾熔岩队！\p"
"不过，那样的话，海洋队\n"
"就会变得更加嚣张了吧？$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:340
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_RocketsBoggleMyMind"
msgid ""
"A giant chunk of metal bursts through\n"
"the skies and flies into space…\p"
"It boggles my mind!$"
msgstr ""
"一大块金属冲破天空，\n"
"飞向宇宙……\p"
"真是不可思议！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:345
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_MagmaWantsToSpoilMyDream"
msgid ""
"A giant chunk of metal bursts through\n"
"the skies and flies into space…\p"
"But TEAM MAGMA wants to spoil\n"
"that dream of mine!\p"
"I'm not having any of that!$"
msgstr ""
"一大块金属冲破天空，\n"
"飞向宇宙……\p"
"可是熔岩队却想\n"
"破坏我的梦想！\p"
"我绝不允许！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:352
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_StevenMagmaCantBeAllowedToTakeFuel"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: {PLAYER}{KUN}, have you read that\n"
"proclamation already?\p"
"TEAM MAGMA is coming after the rocket\n"
"fuel on this island.\p"
"I don't know what they'd need it for,\n"
"but they can't be allowed to take it.\p"
"I'll keep an eye on things for\n"
"a while longer.\p"
"In the meantime, why don't you go\n"
"check out the town?$"
msgstr ""
"大吾：{PLAYER}{KUN}，\n"
"你已经看过那份声明了吗？\p"
"熔岩队要来抢这座岛上的\n"
"火箭燃料。\p"
"我不知道他们要燃料做什么，\n"
"但绝不能让他们得逞。\p"
"我会再留意一下这里的情况。\p"
"在这段时间里，\n"
"你要不要去城里看看？$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:364
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_Grunt3Intro"
msgid ""
"As promised, we've come for\n"
"the rocket fuel!$"
msgstr ""
"按照约定，\n"
"我们来拿火箭燃料了！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:368
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_Grunt3Defeat"
msgid "Ran out of fuel…$"
msgstr "燃料耗尽了……$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:371
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_Grunt3PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Don't think you're on a roll just\n"
"because you've beaten me!$"
msgstr ""
"别以为赢了我\n"
"就可以得意忘形了！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:375
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_Grunt1Intro"
msgid ""
"We gave you fair warning!\n"
"There's nothing sneaky about us!$"
msgstr ""
"我们可是事先警告过了！\n"
"我们一点都不卑鄙！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:379
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_Grunt1Defeat"
msgid ""
"Grrr…\n"
"We should've used sneaky treachery…$"
msgstr ""
"可恶……\n"
"早知道就该用卑鄙的手段……$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:383
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_Grunt1PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Okay, I get it already! The next time,\n"
"we'll come unannounced.$"
msgstr ""
"好啦，我知道了！\n"
"下次我们会不打招呼就来。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:387
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_Grunt4Intro"
msgid ""
"The rocket fuel the SPACE CENTER has\n"
"in storage--that's what we're after.\p"
"We mean to take every last bit of it!$"
msgstr ""
"宇宙中心储存的火箭燃料——\n"
"那就是我们的目标。\p"
"我们要把它们一滴不剩地全部拿走！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:392
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_Grunt4Defeat"
msgid ""
"Please, can you spare some fuel?\n"
"Even a chintzy cup will do!$"
msgstr ""
"拜托，能分我一点燃料吗？\n"
"一小杯就够了！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:396
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_Grunt4PostBattle"
msgid ""
"What are we going to do with\n"
"the rocket fuel?\p"
"How would I know?\n"
"Ask our leader upstairs!$"
msgstr ""
"我们要拿火箭燃料做什么？\p"
"我怎么会知道？\n"
"去问楼上的首领吧！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:402
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_Grunt2Intro"
msgid ""
"Our leader said no one, but no one,\n"
"gets past me!$"
msgstr ""
"首领说了，谁都不能，\n"
"谁都不能从我这里通过！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:406
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_Grunt2Defeat"
msgid "Ack! Ack! Aaack!$"
msgstr "啊！啊！啊啊啊！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:409
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_Grunt2PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Please, tell our leader that\n"
"I never abandoned my post.\l"
"That I stayed to the bitter end…$"
msgstr ""
"拜托，请告诉首领，\n"
"我绝对没有擅离职守。\l"
"我一直坚守到了最后……$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F/scripts.inc:414
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_MagmaIntentToStealNotice"
msgid ""
"This is…\n"
"An intent-to-steal notice?\p"
"“To the staff of the SPACE CENTER:\n"
"How are you? We are doing fine.\p"
"“We will soon visit you to take your\n"
"rocket fuel.\p"
"“Please don't try to stop us.\n"
"We will take the fuel no matter what.\p"
"“Let there be more land!\n"
"                                          TEAM MAGMA”$"
msgstr ""
"这是……\n"
"盗窃预告信？\p"
"“致宇宙中心的工作人员：\n"
"你们好吗？我们很好。\p"
"“我们近期将前来拜访，\n"
"拿走你们的火箭燃料。\p"
"“请不要试图阻止我们。\n"
"无论如何我们都会拿走燃料。\p"
"“让陆地更加广阔吧！\n"
"                          熔岩队”$"
